  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Leaders and Defenders Prevention and Protection Programme II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to improve protection and prevention mechanisms for women human rights defenders and peace builders in four Colombian regions (Antioquia, Cauca, Choc&#xF3; and Nari&#xF1;o); and to achieve socioeconomic reincorporation of women peace [agreement] signatories [former FARC combatants]. This will be accomplished through (1) the implementation of prevention and protection strategies of women leaders, human rights defenders and women peace signatories in coordination with territorial and national entities; (2) the committment of public entities to the prevention and protection agenda for women human rights leaders and defenders and to Colombia&apos;s fist National Action Plan 1325; and (3) the exchange of experiences of women peacebuilders among territories and peers to strengthen their associative capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
